    "description": "Mine (stage 1), level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 280 blocks vs 170 (first build 222 vs 70: the spoil mound is most of it). Stage 1 only (headframe and winch house are later stages). Builders never dig: a timber-framed adit, 3 wide and 2 high, runs 6 blocks into a built rocky spoil mound; miners dig down from its end. L2 adds the rail track, a hood over the entrance, lanterns, a tool rack, an ore bin and gravel spoil heaps; L3 sign, banners, lantern posts, moss, flowers and bushes on the mound. Not yet builder-tested: rail. Decoration step adds: item, item_frame.",
